@startuml
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #0B7A75
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F4FAF9
  BorderColor #0B7A75
  FontColor #14312F
  FontSize 13
}

title The Gate decides on what it can observe: the address, then the method

[*] --> Received

state "Request at the edge" as Received
state "The one Gate op address" as Op
state "A registered callback address" as Callback
state "A bare domain name" as Bare
state "Refused" as Refused #FDF2F2
state "Dispatched to the tool that handles it" as Dispatched #F2F9F4

Received --> Op : the URI is the Gate op address
Received --> Callback : the URI is an address\nthe Gate registered\nwith a third party
Received --> Bare : the URI is a bare\ndomain name
Received --> Refused : any other URI — **404**

Op --> Dispatched : **POST**\nverify the token,\ncollect the facts,\ndispatch
Op --> Refused : **GET** — this address serves\nonly traffic the firm originates,\nand the firm requires POST

Callback --> Dispatched : **the sender's method, whatever it is**\nverify the signed state it carries,\ncollect the facts, dispatch

Bare --> Op : redirect to the Gate

Refused --> [*]
Dispatched --> [*]

@enduml
